---
import BaseLayout from "@/layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---

<BaseLayout pageTitle="AI Tools Assessment Report Builder" pageDescription="Internal printable AI Tools Assessment report template." noindex minimal>
  <div class="report-builder">
    <div class="toolbar"><a href="/ops/ai-assessment-playbook/">← Field Office / Assessment</a><span>Report builder · dotted fields are editable</span><button type="button" onclick="window.print()">Print / Save PDF</button></div>
    <main>
      <section class="page cover">
        <div class="brand"><span>AI</span><i></i></div>
        <p>AI Tools Assessment</p>
        <h1 contenteditable="true">[Client name]</h1>
        <div class="cover-meta"><label>Business type<strong contenteditable="true">[Industry]</strong></label><label>Prepared for<strong contenteditable="true">[Owner / team]</strong></label><label>Date<strong contenteditable="true">[Month DD, YYYY]</strong></label><label>Primary focus<strong contenteditable="true">[Efficiency / effectiveness / quality]</strong></label></div>
        <footer>Prepared by Danny Sullivan · Raleigh, North Carolina</footer>
      </section>

      <section class="page summary">
        <header><span>02</span><p>Executive summary</p></header>
        <h2>The clearest path to <em contenteditable="true">[primary outcome].</em></h2>
        <div class="summary-grid"><article><span>Main pain point</span><p contenteditable="true">[Describe the operational friction in the client’s own language.]</p></article><article><span>Expected outcome</span><p contenteditable="true">[Describe what becomes faster, easier, or better.]</p></article><article class="hours"><strong contenteditable="true">[5–10]</strong><span>hours reclaimed<br />per week</span></article></div>
        <h3>Effort vs. impact</h3>
        <div class="matrix"><span class="axis impact">Higher impact →</span><span class="axis effort">More effort →</span><div class="quadrant"><small>High impact · Low effort</small><b>QUICK WINS</b><p contenteditable="true">[Tool 1]<br />[Tool 2]</p></div><div class="quadrant"><small>High impact · High effort</small><b>BIG BETS</b><p contenteditable="true">[Future opportunity]</p></div><div class="quadrant"><small>Low impact · Low effort</small><b>FILL-INS</b><p contenteditable="true">[Optional]</p></div><div class="quadrant"><small>Low impact · High effort</small><b>SKIP</b><p contenteditable="true">[Do not pursue]</p></div></div>
        <footer>Danny Sullivan · AI Tools Assessment</footer>
      </section>

      <section class="page recommendations">
        <header><span>03</span><p>Your prescription</p></header>
        <h2>Three moves to make first.</h2>
        <div class="recommendation-list">
          {[1,2,3].map((item) => <article><span>0{item}</span><div><small contenteditable="true">[PAIN POINT]</small><h3 contenteditable="true">[Tool or workflow name]</h3><p contenteditable="true">[Explain why this fits, what it replaces, and the first useful behavior.]</p><ul><li><b>Setup</b><i contenteditable="true">[10 minutes]</i></li><li><b>Cost</b><i contenteditable="true">[$ / month]</i></li><li><b>Weekly opportunity</b><i contenteditable="true">[X hours]</i></li></ul></div></article>)}
        </div>
        <footer>Danny Sullivan · AI Tools Assessment</footer>
      </section>

      <section class="page quickstart">
        <header><span>04</span><p>Four-day quick start</p></header>
        <h2>Ten minutes a day.<br /><em>Momentum by Friday.</em></h2>
        <ol>{["Create the account", "Connect one workflow", "Use it on real work", "Review and standardize"].map((title,index) => <li><span>DAY {index + 1}</span><div><h3>{title}</h3><p contenteditable="true">[Write one concrete action the client can complete in ten minutes or less.]</p></div><strong>10<br /><small>MIN</small></strong></li>)}</ol>
        <footer>Danny Sullivan · AI Tools Assessment</footer>
      </section>

      <section class="page financial">
        <header><span>05</span><p>Financial impact</p></header>
        <h2>The value hiding in the week.</h2>
        <div class="equation"><div><span>Weekly hours</span><strong contenteditable="true">[7]</strong></div><b>×</b><div><span>Hourly value</span><strong contenteditable="true">[$100]</strong></div><b>×</b><div><span>Weeks / month</span><strong>4.33</strong></div><b>=</b><div class="result"><span>Monthly opportunity</span><strong contenteditable="true">[$3,031]</strong></div></div>
        <div class="cost-table"><div><span>Recommended tools</span><strong contenteditable="true">[$XX / month]</strong></div><div><span>Estimated monthly opportunity</span><strong contenteditable="true">[$X,XXX]</strong></div><div><span>Potential net value</span><strong contenteditable="true">[$X,XXX / month]</strong></div></div>
        <p class="assumption"><b>Calculation note</b><span contenteditable="true">[Explain the source of the time and hourly-value assumptions. This is an opportunity estimate, not a promised financial return.]</span></p>
        <footer>Danny Sullivan · AI Tools Assessment</footer>
      </section>

      <section class="page nextsteps">
        <header><span>06</span><p>Next steps</p></header>
        <h2>Start with the smallest useful change.</h2>
        <div class="decision"><span>FIRST PRIORITY</span><h3 contenteditable="true">[Recommendation the client chose as most urgent]</h3><p contenteditable="true">[Why it matters and the date they intend to begin.]</p></div>
        <div class="paths"><article><span>DO IT YOURSELF</span><h3>Use the four-day plan.</h3><p>Start with the prescribed quick wins and schedule a 30-day check-in to review what changed.</p></article><article><span>BUILD IT TOGETHER</span><h3>Continue with Danny.</h3><p>Use a focused implementation project or twice-monthly AI concierge sessions to audit, optimize, and automate the next workflow.</p></article></div>
        <div class="review-notes"><span>Review decisions</span><p contenteditable="true">[Most urgent recommendation · DIY or help · Timeline · Owner]</p></div>
        <footer>Danny Sullivan · dannysullivan.ai</footer>
      </section>
    </main>
  </div>
</BaseLayout>

<style>
  :global(body){background:#d7d5cf}.report-builder{--orange:#f06000;--ink:#070707;color:var(--ink);font-family:"Instrument Sans",sans-serif}.toolbar{position:sticky;top:0;z-index:20;display:flex;justify-content:center;gap:2rem;align-items:center;padding:.7rem;color:#fff;background:#111;font-size:.7rem}.toolbar a{position:absolute;left:1rem}.toolbar button{position:absolute;right:1rem;padding:.5rem .7rem;color:#111;background:#dfff54;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}.report-builder main{padding:3rem 0}.page{position:relative;width:min(100% - 28px,8.5in);min-height:11in;margin:0 auto 2rem;padding:.65in;background:#faf9f5;box-shadow:0 8px 30px #0002;overflow:hidden;break-after:page}.page>header{display:flex;gap:.8rem;padding-bottom:.8rem;border-bottom:2px solid;font-size:.65rem;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.page>header span{color:var(--orange)}.page>footer{position:absolute;right:.65in;bottom:.38in;left:.65in;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding-top:.15in;border-top:1px solid;font-size:.52rem;font-weight:750;text-transform:uppercase}.brand{display:grid;place-items:center;width:1.05in;height:1.05in;background:#000;color:#fff}.brand span{font-family:"Anybody";font-size:.42in;font-weight:900}.brand i{width:.55in;height:.08in;background:var(--orange)}.cover>p{margin-top:1.7in;color:var(--orange);font-size:.13in;font-weight:850;letter-spacing:.12em;text-transform:uppercase}.cover h1{max-width:6.5in;margin:.15in 0 .65in;font-family:"Anybody";font-size:.85in;font-weight:900;line-height:.85;text-transform:uppercase}.cover-meta{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.3in;border-top:2px solid;padding-top:.3in}.cover-meta label{font-size:.1in;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}.cover-meta strong{display:block;margin-top:.08in;font-size:.16in;text-transform:none}.page h2{margin:.35in 0;font-family:"Anybody";font-size:.53in;font-weight:900;line-height:.9;text-transform:uppercase}.page h2 em{color:var(--orange);font-style:normal}.summary-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr .75fr;gap:.12in}.summary-grid article{min-height:1.2in;padding:.18in;color:#fff;background:#111}.summary-grid span{font-size:.09in;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}.summary-grid p{margin-top:.2in;font-size:.12in;line-height:1.45}.summary-grid .hours{display:flex;flex-direction:column;justify-content:space-between;color:#111;background:var(--orange)}.hours strong{font-family:"Anybody";font-size:.65in;line-height:.8}.summary h3{margin:.4in 0 .12in;font-family:"Anybody";font-size:.22in;text-transform:uppercase}.matrix{position:relative;display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:2px;padding-left:.4in;background:#111}.quadrant{min-height:1.15in;padding:.13in;background:#faf9f5}.quadrant:first-of-type{background:#dfff54}.quadrant small{font-size:.075in;text-transform:uppercase}.quadrant b{display:block;margin:.08in 0;font-family:"Anybody";font-size:.17in}.quadrant p{font-size:.1in;line-height:1.4}.axis{position:absolute;font-size:.07in;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}.axis.impact{left:-.36in;top:45%;transform:rotate(-90deg)}.axis.effort{bottom:-.16in;left:46%}.recommendation-list{border-top:2px solid}.recommendation-list article{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.5in 1fr;gap:.15in;padding:.25in 0;border-bottom:1px solid}.recommendation-list article>span{color:var(--orange);font-weight:850}.recommendation-list small{color:var(--orange);font-size:.08in;font-weight:850}.recommendation-list h3{font-family:"Anybody";font-size:.27in;text-transform:uppercase}.recommendation-list p{max-width:5.3in;margin:.06in 0 .12in;font-size:.11in;line-height:1.45}.recommendation-list ul{display:flex;gap:.25in}.recommendation-list li{font-size:.085in}.recommendation-list li b,.recommendation-list li i{display:block}.recommendation-list li i{margin-top:.02in;font-size:.1in;font-style:normal}.quickstart ol{border-top:2px solid}.quickstart li{display:grid;grid-template-columns:.65in 1fr .55in;gap:.2in;align-items:center;padding:.22in 0;border-bottom:1px solid}.quickstart li>span{color:var(--orange);font-size:.09in;font-weight:850}.quickstart h3{font-family:"Anybody";font-size:.23in;text-transform:uppercase}.quickstart p{margin-top:.04in;font-size:.105in}.quickstart li>strong{display:grid;place-items:center;width:.55in;height:.55in;border:2px solid;border-radius:50%;font-family:"Anybody";font-size:.2in;line-height:.7;text-align:center;transform:rotate(4deg)}.quickstart li>strong small{font-size:.065in}.equation{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr auto 1fr auto 1fr auto 1.2fr;gap:.12in;align-items:center;margin:.6in 0}.equation>div{padding:.15in;border:2px solid}.equation>div.result{color:#111;background:#dfff54}.equation span,.cost-table span{display:block;font-size:.08in;font-weight:800;text-transform:uppercase}.equation strong{display:block;margin-top:.08in;font-family:"Anybody";font-size:.3in}.cost-table{border-top:2px solid}.cost-table div{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;padding:.18in 0;border-bottom:1px solid}.cost-table strong{font-family:"Anybody";font-size:.2in}.assumption{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1in 1fr;gap:.2in;margin-top:.35in;padding:.2in;color:#fff;background:#111;font-size:.1in;line-height:1.5}.assumption b{color:var(--orange);text-transform:uppercase}.decision{padding:.3in;color:#fff;background:#111}.decision>span,.paths span,.review-notes>span{color:var(--orange);font-size:.08in;font-weight:850;text-transform:uppercase}.decision h3{margin:.2in 0 .08in;font-family:"Anybody";font-size:.35in;text-transform:uppercase}.decision p{font-size:.11in}.paths{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:.15in;margin-top:.2in}.paths article{min-height:1.65in;padding:.2in;border:2px solid}.paths article:last-child{color:#111;background:#dfff54}.paths h3{margin:.25in 0 .08in;font-family:"Anybody";font-size:.24in;text-transform:uppercase}.paths p{font-size:.105in;line-height:1.45}.review-notes{margin-top:.25in;padding:.2in;border:1px solid}.review-notes p{margin-top:.1in;font-size:.11in}[contenteditable="true"]{outline:1px dotted #f0600088;outline-offset:2px}.dark .report-builder{color:#070707}
  @media(max-width:700px){.toolbar span{display:none}.toolbar{justify-content:flex-end;padding-inline:1rem}.toolbar a,.toolbar button{position:static}.page{min-height:0;aspect-ratio:8.5/11;padding:.35in;transform-origin:top center}.page>footer{right:.35in;bottom:.2in;left:.35in}.page h2{font-size:.38in}.summary-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr}.summary-grid .hours{grid-column:1/-1;min-height:.8in}.equation{grid-template-columns:1fr}.equation>b{display:none}}
  @media print{:global(header.site-header),:global(.site-footer),.toolbar{display:none!important}:global(body){background:#fff}.report-builder main{padding:0}.page{width:8.5in;height:11in;min-height:11in;margin:0;padding:.65in;box-shadow:none}[contenteditable="true"]{outline:0}@page{size:letter;margin:0}}
</style>

<!-- Screen chrome follows the shared site system; print remains a clean letter-size report. -->
<style>
  :global(body) { background: var(--site-bg); }

  .report-builder {
    --orange: var(--site-accent);
    --ink: #12161d;
    color: var(--site-ink);
    background: var(--site-bg);
    font-family: "Instrument Sans", sans-serif;
  }

  .toolbar { top: 0; min-height: 3.5rem; justify-content: center; border-bottom: 1px solid rgb(255 255 255 / 14%); color: #fafafa; background: #12161d; font-size: .75rem; }
  .toolbar a { color: #fafafa; }
  .toolbar span { color: rgb(255 255 255 / 58%); }
  .toolbar button { min-height: 2.5rem; padding: .6rem 1rem; color: #12161d; background: var(--site-accent); font-size: .7rem; font-weight: 700; }
  .report-builder main { padding: 4rem 0; }

  .page { color: #12161d; background: #fff; box-shadow: 0 18px 60px rgb(18 22 29 / 12%); }
  .page > header { border-color: rgb(18 22 29 / 14%); font-weight: 650; }
  .page > header span { display: grid; width: .25in; height: .25in; place-items: center; border-radius: 999px; color: #12161d; background: var(--site-accent); }
  .page > footer { border-color: rgb(18 22 29 / 12%); color: #71717a; font-weight: 600; }

  .brand { border-radius: .18in; background: #12161d; }
  .brand span { font-size: .36in; font-weight: 750; }
  .brand i { background: var(--site-accent); }
  .cover > p { color: #71717a; font-weight: 650; }
  .cover h1 { font-size: .75in; font-weight: 700; line-height: .95; letter-spacing: -.04em; text-transform: none; }
  .cover-meta { border-color: rgb(18 22 29 / 14%); }
  .cover-meta label { color: #71717a; font-weight: 650; }
  .cover-meta strong { color: #12161d; font-weight: 600; }

  .page h2 { font-size: .46in; font-weight: 700; line-height: 1; letter-spacing: -.035em; text-transform: none; }
  .page h2 em { color: inherit; font-style: normal; text-decoration: underline; text-decoration-color: var(--site-accent); text-decoration-thickness: .09in; text-underline-offset: -.035in; text-decoration-skip-ink: none; }
  .summary-grid article { color: #fafafa; background: #12161d; }
  .summary-grid .hours { color: #12161d; background: var(--site-accent); }
  .summary h3 { font-size: .2in; font-weight: 700; text-transform: none; }
  .matrix { gap: 1px; background: rgb(18 22 29 / 14%); }
  .quadrant { background: #fff; }
  .quadrant:first-of-type { background: var(--site-accent); }
  .quadrant b { font-size: .16in; font-weight: 700; }

  .recommendation-list,
  .quickstart ol,
  .cost-table { border-color: rgb(18 22 29 / 18%); }
  .recommendation-list article,
  .quickstart li,
  .cost-table div { border-color: rgb(18 22 29 / 12%); }
  .recommendation-list article > span,
  .recommendation-list small,
  .quickstart li > span { color: #71717a; }
  .recommendation-list h3,
  .quickstart h3,
  .decision h3,
  .paths h3 { font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: -.02em; text-transform: none; }
  .quickstart li > strong { border-width: 1px; transform: none; }

  .equation > div { border: 1px solid rgb(18 22 29 / 16%); }
  .equation > div.result { color: #12161d; background: var(--site-accent); }
  .assumption,
  .decision { color: #fafafa; background: #12161d; }
  .assumption b,
  .decision > span,
  .paths span,
  .review-notes > span { color: var(--site-accent); }
  .paths article { border: 1px solid rgb(18 22 29 / 16%); }
  .paths article:last-child { border: 0; color: #12161d; background: var(--site-accent); }
  .review-notes { border-color: rgb(18 22 29 / 16%); }
  [contenteditable="true"] { outline-color: rgb(18 22 29 / 28%); }
  [contenteditable="true"]:focus { outline: 2px solid var(--site-accent); outline-offset: 3px; }

  @media (max-width: 700px) {
    .report-builder main { padding-block: 2rem; }
    .page { box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgb(18 22 29 / 10%); }
  }

  @media print {
    :global(.site-header),
    :global(.site-footer),
    .toolbar { display: none !important; }
    :global(body) { background: #fff; }
    .report-builder main { padding: 0; }
    .page { box-shadow: none; }
  }
</style>
